  <metadata>
    <name>Nantucket: Cisco - Surfside - Town Loop</name>
    <desc>Approx. 7.4 mi loop from Young's Bicycle Shop to Cisco Brewers, Surfside Beach and back to town, mostly on separated bike paths. Hand-plotted approximate track; not snapped to roads. Verify in a route planner before riding.</desc>
  </metadata>
